Module market_fixture "A market and a hill path" {
  Description "A test fixture: a market with a chest that holds a jar, a goldsmith who buys it, and a hill where a goat path is found by searching with woodcraft.".
  Place country "The fixture country" is region.
  Place town "the town" is settlement within country at 0, 0.
  Place downs "the downs" is wilderness within country at 1, 0.
  Place market "the market" is room within town at 0, 0.
  Place counting "the counting-room" is room within town at 1, 0.
  Place switchbacks "the switchbacks" is room within downs at 0, 0.
  Place shoulder "the shoulder" is room within downs at 1, 0.
  Passage counting_door "the counting-room door" is door between market and counting.
  Passage hill_road "the hill road" is road between market and switchbacks taking 1 hour.
  Passage goat_path "the goat path" is path between switchbacks and shoulder taking 1 hour hidden until goat_path_known.
  Company party "The company" of 3 at market.
  Initially Set quantity(party, gold) to 10. Initially Set quantity(party, rations) to 3.
  Thing chest "the chest" at market { Holds. }
  Item jar "a jar of moonlight" is moonlight in chest.
  Person vane "Iselde Vane" at counting { Role "goldsmith". Ancestry human. Peaceable. Buys moonlight for 12 coin. }
  Initially Set quantity(vane, gold) to 100.
  Discovery goat_path_known "A goat path climbs from the switchbacks over the shoulder of the hill." {
    Found by searching switchbacks with woodcraft "Up the gully: droppings, and the scrape of boot-nails on bare rock.".
  }
  Observe market_scene at market when true "Stalls, and a chest by the well.".
  Observe counting_scene at counting when true "A balance under a glass bell.".
  Observe switchbacks_scene at switchbacks when true "The road turns on itself above a gully.".
  Observe shoulder_scene at shoulder when true "Wind, and the whole valley below.".
  Goal false.
}
